<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoPureFunctionCreate"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoPureFunctionCreate</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoPureFunctionCreate</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Create a wrapper for a pure function</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Function.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoFunction *SilikoPureFunctionCreate(
    SilikoValue *(*function)(int argc, SilikoValue **argv));</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoPureFunctionCreate</function> creates A
<type>SilikoFunction</type> object that wraps
<varname>function</varname> which must be a function that requires no
state object.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoPureFunctionCreate</function> returns the newly
created object if successful, or <literal>NULL</literal> if there was
an error.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
